            },
            "accordion_row_FnQDxQ": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Do these infusions contain caffeine?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_W8agDQ": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The vast majority of our flower and wellness infusions—including Hibiscus Glow, Butterfly Pea, Chamomile, and Rose—are 100% zero-caffeine, making them perfect for any time of the day. Blends that incorporate specific traditional teas, such as Green Tea in <em>Skin Glow</em> or Oolong in <em>Daily Slim & Active</em>, are carefully balanced to provide crash-free, sustained energy.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
