                    "text": "<p>Absolutely. We take your health seriously. All our products are 100% hand-packed and proudly carry <strong>GMP</strong>, <strong>FSSAI</strong>, and <strong>ISO</strong> certifications, ensuring the highest standards of manufacturing and quality control.</p>",
