            "accordion_row_kVnmmb": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How do I brew the perfect cup?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_77Rbhx": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Brewing is a simple, grounding ritual. Generally, you should:</p><ol><li>Place 1 tea bag in a mug.</li><li>Pour 250 ml of hot water over it.</li><li>Let it steep for 5–10 minutes depending on the blend.</li></ol><p><em>Important Note:</em> Temperatures vary by blend to protect delicate nutrients. For example, our Moringa Superfood should be brewed at 80°C to preserve its heat-sensitive vitamins, while robust root blends like Gluco Sugar Balance and Happy Liver steep best at 90°C for 7–10 minutes.<br/><br/></p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
