              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_YjNcWz": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our infusions are naturally free from artificial sugars. Some of our wellness blends (like <em>Gluco Sugar Balance</em> and <em>Happy Heart</em>) contain a touch of natural Stevia leaf for zero-calorie sweetness. If you prefer a sweeter cup, we highly recommend a drizzle of raw honey.</p>",
