                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>For the deepest, most sustained wellness benefits, consistency is key. We recommend sipping <strong>2 to 3 cups daily</strong>. Because our blends work with your body's natural rhythms rather than offering a quick synthetic fix, the most noticeable benefits are typically observed after 4 to 6 weeks of daily use.</p>",
