            "accordion_row_Tm8Rhb": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Are these blends safe if I am pregnant, breastfeeding, or on medication?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_nJ44UE": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our wellness infusions are natural food supplements crafted to support a healthy lifestyle. However, they are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or replace prescribed medical treatments. If you are pregnant, breastfeeding, managing a medical condition (such as diabetes or liver issues), or currently taking medications/hormonal therapy, please consult your healthcare provider before adding these to your routine.</p>",
