              "blocks": {
                "text_PWczNh": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our carefully formulated blends are designed to act as powerful daily companions to your wellness journey. <em>Lady Bloom</em> gently supports hormonal harmony, and <em>Daily Slim & Active</em> supports natural metabolic wellness. However, they work best alongside the pillars of health: a balanced diet, consistent sleep, and gentle daily movement. They are not guaranteed medical cures, but rather daily acts of care for your body.</p>",
