                    "text": "<p>It depends entirely on the blend and your body's needs:</p><ul><li><strong>Mornings:</strong> <em>Moringa Superfood</em> or <em>Lady Bloom</em> for clean energy and a calm foundation.</li><li><strong>Before/After Meals:</strong> <em>Gluco Sugar Balance</em> (20 mins before) or <em>Happy Liver</em> (30 mins after dinner) to prime digestion.</li></ul><p><strong>Evenings:</strong><em>Easy Sleep Chamomile</em> or <em>Rosy Glow</em> to ease into quiet rest and support overnight repair.</p>",
